<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '20px 70px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4, letterSpacing: 1 }}>10 / 待深化研究</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>方向 7：教师干预的跟踪记录</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '7px 16px', borderRadius: 20, background: '#98A2B3' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 600 }}>待研究</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 532, paddingTop: 8, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 28, flex: 1 }}><Box style={{ width: 620, justifyContent: 'center' }}><svg width={620} height={400} viewBox='0 0 620 400'><rect x='0' y='0' width='620' height='400' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#E3E8EF' stroke-width='1.5'/><rect x='0' y='0' width='620' height='40' rx='8' fill='#0E2340'/><rect x='0' y='26' width='620' height='14' fill='#0E2340'/><text x='16' y='26' font-size='15' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='start' font-weight='600'>StudyAgent</text><rect x='18' y='58' width='584' height='26' rx='4' fill='#F5F7FA'/><text x='30' y='76' font-size='14' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='start' font-weight='600'>干预事项看板</text><rect x='18' y='92' width='584' height='52' rx='6' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#7A8699' stroke-width='1' stroke-dasharray='4 4'/><text x='30' y='124' font-size='14' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='start' font-weight='400'>触发依据 · 待验证问题 · 教师选择 · 行动安排</text><rect x='18' y='152' width='584' height='52' rx='6' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#7A8699' stroke-width='1' stroke-dasharray='4 4'/><text x='30' y='184' font-size='14' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='start' font-weight='400'>学生反馈 · 后续证据 · 阶段结论</text><rect x='18' y='212' width='584' height='28' rx='14' fill='#EAF3FD'/><text x='30' y='231' font-size='14' fill='#1E7BE0' text-anchor='start' font-weight='600'>状态：待核实 → 已安排 → 已实施 → 待复测 → 已改善 / 继续跟进 / 证据不足</text><rect x='18' y='248' width='584' height='34' rx='17' fill='#1E7BE0'/><text x='310.0' y='271' font-size='15' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>关闭误报 · 合并重复提醒 · 关联小组行动</text><text x='608' y='390' font-size='12' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='end' font-weight='400'>示意占位 · S33</text></svg></Box><Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>界面要点</Text><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 9 }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>已有参考：LA Cockpit（Journal of Learning Analytics 2024）准实验研究，16 名教师、22 个班、403 名学生，把看板使用、反馈实践与前后测知识变化作为连续影响链。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>干预事项七要素：触发依据、待验证问题、教师选择、行动安排、学生反馈、后续证据、阶段结论。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>行动完成与问题解决分别记录，避免“谈过一次”或“补练完成”就自动标为掌握。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>防负担：同一目标重复提醒合并，显示证据变化而非新增任务；支持小组与全班行动。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>优先级结合问题持续性、涉及范围、前置影响、现有任务、教师可用时间，不直接由低分排列；首期从“单个步骤的课堂补充或小组补练”切入。</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ marginTop: 6, padding: '9px 14px', background: '#F5F7FA', borderRadius: 6, alignSelf: 'flex-start' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>示意占位 S33 · 待替换为实际截图</Text></Box></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8EF', marginTop: 8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>依据：待深化功能研究.md §4</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}> 101 / 124 </Text></Box></Slide>